            <ArticleTitle>The Evolving Health Policy Landscape and Suggested Geriatric Tenets to Guide Future Responses.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>462-465</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/jgs.14849</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We cannot view the future of healthcare but we can sense that big changes are afoot. Many revolve around the plans to &quot;repeal and replace&quot; the Affordable Care Act. We speculate on some potential areas of change in the context of a set of tenets about what care for older persons should address.</AbstractText>
